@startuml
title Help With COVID – Session and Task Workflow Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 220

actor "Authenticated User" as AuthUser
actor "End User (Channel/Form)" as EndUser

component "Env Config\n(FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN\nFIREBASE_DATABASE_URL\nFIREBASE_PROJECT_ID\nFIREBASE_PUBLIC_API_KEY)" as EnvConfig <<config>>

package "Frontend (Next.js)" as Frontend {
  component "Session Handler" as SessionHandler
  component "Frontend Form" as FrontendForm
  component "Firebase JS SDK" as FirebaseClient <<library>>
}

package "Middleware" as Middleware {
  component "Task Middleware\n(Address→Neighborhood,\nService-area check)" as TaskMW
}

package "Backend (Next.js API Routes + Firebase Functions)" as Backend {
  component "/api/login (POST)" as LoginAPI
  component "/api/logout (POST)" as LogoutAPI
  component "Session Middleware\n(Server-side session)" as SessionMW
  component "Task Handler" as TaskHandler
  component "Firebase Admin\nToken Verification" as FirebaseAdmin <<service>>
}

cloud "OnFleet" as OnFleet
component "External User Channel\n(Text/Call)" as ExternalChannel <<channel>>

AuthUser --> SessionHandler : Firebase auth\n(user.getIdToken())
SessionHandler --> FirebaseClient : Get ID token

SessionHandler --> LoginAPI : POST /api/login\nContent-Type: application/json\ncredentials: same-origin\n{ token }
SessionHandler --> LogoutAPI : POST /api/logout\ncredentials: same-origin

LoginAPI ..> SessionMW : executes with\nserver-side session
LogoutAPI ..> SessionMW : executes with\nserver-side session

LoginAPI --> FirebaseAdmin : verifyIdToken(token)
FirebaseAdmin --> LoginAPI : decoded token

LoginAPI --> SessionMW : write session.auth = { decoded, token }
LoginAPI --> SessionHandler : 200 JSON\n{ status, decoded }

EnvConfig --> FirebaseClient : runtime config
EnvConfig --> Backend : runtime config

EndUser --> FrontendForm : submit help-task
EndUser --> ExternalChannel : text/call request

FrontendForm --> TaskMW : pass task request
ExternalChannel --> TaskMW : pass task request

TaskMW --> TaskHandler : eligible request
TaskHandler --> OnFleet : create task
TaskMW ..> EndUser : out-of-service-area\nresponse

note right of LoginAPI
- 400 if body missing
- Extract token from req.body
- Verify Firebase ID token
- Store decoded token and token in session
- Return 200 JSON on success
end note

note top of EnvConfig
Runtime configuration from environment variables
end note

note "Run modes:\n- both servers\n- frontend-only\n- backend-only" as RunModes
RunModes .. Frontend
RunModes .. Backend

@enduml
